Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_databases
Fix: Set net.tls.mode: requireTLS, with a certificate.
References: mongod.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 3.10; NIST SC-8; ISO 5.14, 8.24

MongoDB takes unencrypted connections from the network: no TLS
is configured, and it listens past localhost. Turn TLS on where
the network reaches it.
